`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
The core problem: the penguin's white belly faces HIGH Z, but the front camera looks from LOW Z — so you see the black back. The fix is to mirror all front-facing features (belly, face, beak, eyes, feet) to low Z, and move back features to high Z. This is a Z-coordinate mirror around Z≈200.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`
